      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "下水道的管道堵住了，\n好像是巨大的宝可梦造成的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0B6C34905376847BA1905358354F4F4E86FF0C000A597D50CF662F5DE8592776845B9D53EF68A6902062107684300200100002011401C50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "巨大的宝可梦应该很难对付吧？\n所以这时就轮到你出场了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5DE8592776845B9D53EF68A65E948BE55F8896BE5BF94ED85427FF1F000A62404EE58FD965F65C318F6E52304F6051FA573A4E86300200100002011401C50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我会把疑似宝可梦卡住的地点坐标\n发到你的地图上，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n你就靠引导之类的去调查一下吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114F1A628A75914F3C5B9D53EF68A653614F4F7684573070B957506807000A53D152304F607684573056FE4E0AFF0C00100001BE00000A4F605C3197605F155BFC4E4B7C7B768453BB8C0367E54E004E0B5427300200100002011401C50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我会把坐标发到你的地图上，\n你就靠引导之类的去调查一下吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
